UID: REQ-ONE-PAGE-RENDERS-THE-WHOLE-CANON
TITLE: One page renders every root and every node of the canon
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
One render holds every root narrative and every node -- cited or not -- with the systems of NAR-CANON-SYSTEMS as switches. A single-root render is the same page with one root, for iterating on a view. The whole page is one self-contained file under the artifact host's size limit.
<<<
